---
description: >-
  Same two-section task layout as the sibling tick-interval fixtures,
  with tickInterval set to 1month so axis ticks are spaced monthly.
---
gantt
  title A Gantt Diagram
  dateFormat   YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat   %m-%d
  tickInterval 1month
  excludes     weekends

  section Section
  A task           : a1, 2022-10-01, 30d
  Another task     : after a1, 20d
  section Another
  Task in sec      : 2022-10-20, 12d
  another task     : 24d
